    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/apartment-4-college-court-kings-inns-street-north-city-centre-dublin-d01-n993\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present Apartment 4 College Court, North City Centre.\r\n\r\nNestled in the vibrant North City Centre of Dublin, this apartment offers a blend of comfort and convenience. This inviting two-bedroom apartment is located within a well-maintained, modern building characterised by its sleek architecture and a welcoming entryway. The property boasts a charming exterior with a pathway flanked by manicured lawns and shrubbery enhancing its kerb appeal.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the apartment, you are greeted by a bright and spacious hallway leading to a variety of well-proportioned living spaces. The open-plan living and dining area is a standout feature, enhanced by large windows filling the room with ample natural light, creating an airy ambience suitable for both relaxation and entertaining. The kitchen, efficiently designed, offers modern cabinetry and integrated appliances, providing a practical workspace for culinary endeavours.\r\n\r\nThe apartment further comprises two generously sized bedrooms, each with large windows ensuring a pleasant influx of light. The master bedroom includes built-in wardrobes, offering convenient storage solutions, while the second bedroom also provides ample room for personalisation.\r\n\r\nA tastefully appointed bathroom caters to the needs of the household with elegant fixtures and a contemporary design.\r\n\r\nSituated in a lively neighbourhood, the apartment benefits from its proximity to an array of local amenities including cafes, shops, and parks, making it an ideal urban retreat. Its location is further enhanced by excellent transport links, with nearby bus stops providing easy access to Dublin’s extensive transport network, facilitating efficient commutes.\r\n\r\nThis property is perfect for first-time buyers eager to immerse themselves in city living or investors seeking a promising addition to their portfolio. Offering a combination of style, functionality, and location, it presents an excellent opportunity to enjoy the best of Dublin city living."
      },
